<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_fleqn">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">An integrated process for design and control of lunar robotics using AI and simulation</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_journal"><span class="ltx_note_name">Journal: </span>Journal of <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_LaTeX_logo" style="letter-spacing:-0.2em; margin-right:0.1em;">L<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.4ex;font-variant:small-caps;;">a</span>T<span id="id1.2" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.2ex;font-variant:small-caps;font-size:120%;">e</span>X</span> Templates</span></span></span>
