<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>System prompt</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The system prompt used with the OpenAI <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">o4-mini-2025-04-16</span> model, with reasoning effort set to low, is reproduced below. It specifies the scene, defines the available skills, and prescribes the expected response format of the VLM.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">high</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">-</span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">level</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">lunar</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">rover</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">controller</span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style